     3413   _stroka:
     3414   REPEAT ON ERROR UNDO, leave:
     3415       empty temp-table temp-clients.
     3416       empty temp-table  temp-firm.
     3417       empty temp-table  temp-person.
     3418       my-seek1 = seek(Instream).
