     4061        run err-write in this-procedure ( input-output my-mess).
     4062        return.
     4063      end.
     4064      DO TRANSACTION ON STOP UNDO, NEXT _stroka ON ERROR UNDO, NEXT _stroka:
     4065       if my-obj-code > 0 then do:
