     4087                   next _stroka.
     4088                 end.
     4089               END.
     4090               WHEN 'чел':U then do:
     4091                 FIND FIRST ub.person exclusive-lock WHERE
     4092                            ub.person.psn-code = my-obj-code No-WAIT NO-ERROR.
     4093                 IF NOT AVAIL ub.person then do:
